  message: "Closed in PR #3898 (1ac8ee888d). Outcome Path B (remove dead code). Empirical: 3 repos × 100 top-100 positions × 2 metrics (membership + ordering) = 600 zero-deltas in the canonical pipeline; apply_common_method_name_weights (threshold=10) does the actual work on large name groups, leaving sibling_impl with no symbols to demote that weren't already buried. Canonical stack reduced 8 → 7 stages. Net: -267 lines (87 from ranking.py, 229 from test_ranking.py, 13 from test_sketch.py, 1 from compact.py)."  # d840
